==============================================================================
splink_udfs — Soundex implementation
==============================================================================

Vendored file: src/include/vendored_soundex.hpp
Source:        https://github.com/moj-analytical-services/splink_udfs/blob/main/src/include/phonetic/soundex.hpp

The header is a self-contained C++ Soundex encoder. We use it via the
`soundex` scalar function registered in src/us_geocoder_extension.cpp.
Vendoring this single file lets us drop the splink_udfs runtime dependency
(see CLAUDE.md / README.md "Runtime dependencies"), keeping us_geocoder's
install footprint to just core DuckDB + spatial + (optionally)
us_address_standardizer.

